{"4301540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Creature Caretaker", "steam_appid": 4301540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise Your Own Digital Companion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember the joy of caring for a virtual pet? Creature Caretaker brings that magic back with modern depth and charm. Hatch a unique creature and guide it through life—from its first wobbly steps as an infant to wisdom-filled days as an elder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Life Worth Living</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your creature isn't just a pet—it's a life to nurture. Watch it grow through 12 distinct life stages, each unlocking new abilities and challenges. Help it land jobs, earn money, buy a home, and even pay rent when adulthood arrives. Will you raise a responsible citizen or a carefree spirit?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Deep Care System</strong> - Balance hunger, happiness, energy, and health. Bathe your creature, put it to bed, and nurse it back to health when sick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Career Progression</strong> - Start from humble beginnings and climb the career ladder across multiple job paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Music Studio</strong> - Create beats across 24 electronic genres with 150+ style keywords. Save tracks to your creature's personal music app.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Mini-Games Galore</strong> - Play Emoji Match, Word Scramble, Quick Draw, Tap Sequence, and more. Win daily prizes and build win streaks for bonus rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Companion Pets</strong> - Adopt cats, dogs, birds, hamsters, or fish. Each has unique behaviors, growth stages, and care needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Garden &amp; Kitchen</strong> - Grow crops in expandable plots, raise chickens for eggs, and cook meals in your kitchen with a smart fridge and stove.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Social Life</strong> - Make friends with 50 procedurally generated creatures, each with unique personalities, aging, and social media posts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Salon Makeovers</strong> - Choose from 51 hand-drawn hairstyles across 6 categories and 12 hair colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Home Customization</strong> - Decorate your creature's home with furniture, unlock a second room, and personalize wall and floor colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>TV Entertainment</strong> - Watch procedurally generated shows, check the weather, catch the news, or play deep TV games including a roguelike deck-builder, dungeon crawler, and streaming tycoon sim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Real Consequences</strong> - Get mugged carrying too much cash, face landlord visits if you miss rent, or rush to the hospital in an ambulance when health fails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Y2K Aesthetic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wrapped in charming pixel art and retro vibes, Creature Caretaker delivers the cozy nostalgia of 90s virtual pets with the depth modern players crave. Your creature blinks, dances, expresses emotions, and lives a full life—all in the palm of your hand.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise Your Own Digital Companion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember the joy of caring for a virtual pet? Creature Caretaker brings that magic back with modern depth and charm. Hatch a unique creature and guide it through life—from its first wobbly steps as an infant to wisdom-filled days as an elder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Life Worth Living</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your creature isn't just a pet—it's a life to nurture. Watch it grow through 12 distinct life stages, each unlocking new abilities and challenges. Help it land jobs, earn money, buy a home, and even pay rent when adulthood arrives. Will you raise a responsible citizen or a carefree spirit?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Deep Care System</strong> - Balance hunger, happiness, energy, and health. Bathe your creature, put it to bed, and nurse it back to health when sick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Career Progression</strong> - Start from humble beginnings and climb the career ladder across multiple job paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Music Studio</strong> - Create beats across 24 electronic genres with 150+ style keywords. Save tracks to your creature's personal music app.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Mini-Games Galore</strong> - Play Emoji Match, Word Scramble, Quick Draw, Tap Sequence, and more. Win daily prizes and build win streaks for bonus rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Companion Pets</strong> - Adopt cats, dogs, birds, hamsters, or fish. Each has unique behaviors, growth stages, and care needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Garden &amp; Kitchen</strong> - Grow crops in expandable plots, raise chickens for eggs, and cook meals in your kitchen with a smart fridge and stove.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Social Life</strong> - Make friends with 50 procedurally generated creatures, each with unique personalities, aging, and social media posts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Salon Makeovers</strong> - Choose from 51 hand-drawn hairstyles across 6 categories and 12 hair colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Home Customization</strong> - Decorate your creature's home with furniture, unlock a second room, and personalize wall and floor colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>TV Entertainment</strong> - Watch procedurally generated shows, check the weather, catch the news, or play deep TV games including a roguelike deck-builder, dungeon crawler, and streaming tycoon sim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Real Consequences</strong> - Get mugged carrying too much cash, face landlord visits if you miss rent, or rush to the hospital in an ambulance when health fails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Y2K Aesthetic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wrapped in charming pixel art and retro vibes, Creature Caretaker delivers the cozy nostalgia of 90s virtual pets with the depth modern players crave. Your creature blinks, dances, expresses emotions, and lives a full life—all in the palm of your hand.</p>", "short_description": "Creature Caretaker is a virtual pet simulator. Hatch your creature from an egg, and help it build a career, make friends, grow a garden, and express itself through music. Manage hunger, happiness, energy, and health while exploring a vibrant pixel-art world filled with mini-games, &amp; companion pets.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301540/b813089539ecf5bc20df0fc0e871bf182462ef04/header.jpg?t=1783979151", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301540/b05f6af6067d773b4ba20c0cc69031556bdc8847/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783979151", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4301540/b05f6af6067d773b4ba20c0cc69031556bdc8847/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783979151", "website": "https://whamblam-shop.fourthwall.com/pages/creature-caretaker-merch-privacy-policy", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or AMD equivalent (2.0 GHz+)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics (Intel HD 4000 or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>